Method 1, the reversal trick (learn this one)
Postorder is left, right, root . Reverse that sequence and you get root, right, left . And
root, right, left is just preorder with the two pushes swapped, which we already know how to
write.
So: do a preorder with right and left swapped, then reverse the result.
